      "body": "Full year 2026 results: ₹7.88 loss per share (down from ₹11.58 profit in FY 2025). Revenue: ₹45.2b (down 6.4% from FY 2025). Net loss: ₹908.6m (down 168% from profit in FY 2025). Revenue was in line with analyst estimates. Earnings per share (EPS) missed analyst estimates. Revenue is forecast to grow 11% p.a. on average during the next 2 years, compared to a 14% growth forecast for the Consumer Durables industry in India. Over the last 3 years on average, earnings per share has fallen by 53% per year but the company’s share price has only fallen by 31% per year, which means it has not declined as severely as earnings.",
